    "text": "dukeblogger.com\nwebsite\nDuke\nCongrats to Jayce McCain for Being Named Player Development Specialist for Duke Men’s Basketball\nBy Brian Horace,\n10 hours agoDuke men’s basketball head coach Jon Scheyer announced Wednesday the addition of Jayce McCain to the Blue Devils’ staff as Player Development Specialist. McCain, who spent the past two seasons as a graduate assistant with the program, recently completed his master’s degree at Duke and brings a strong background in player development, leadership and basketball operations.",
